{"id":"recorde","lemma":"recorde","pos":"adj","rank":2499,"glosses":["record-breaking (beating the previous record)","extreme; intense; drastic"],"ipa":"/ʁɛˈkɔɾ.dɨ/","forms":{"plural":"recordes"},"examples":[{"text":"Ele bateu o recorde.","en":"He has broken the record.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to beat","l":"bater"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"É um recorde mundial.","en":"It's a world record.","words":[{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"global"}]},{"text":"Ninguém pode bater o seu recorde.","en":"Nobody can break his record.","words":[{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to be able to","l":"poder"},{"g":"to beat"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"his"},null]},{"text":"Seu recorde nunca será batido.","en":"His record will never be broken.","words":[{"g":"his"},null,{"g":"never (at no time"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"to beat","l":"bater"}]},{"text":"Tom quebrou o recorde.","en":"Tom broke the record.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"to break","l":"quebrar"},{"g":"the / it"},null]}]}